Package: camtrad
Type: Package
Title: Dictionary-Based Translation Between French and Cameroonian Languages
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Morelle Sandrine", "Djambou Nitcheu",
           email = "djamsmorelle604@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Tools to translate short texts word by word between French and
    Cameroonian languages (Bassa, Bafang) using a user-built lexicon. Includes
    a lexicon-based language detector, a translator tolerant to spelling
    mistakes, a combined function that detects the source language before
    translating, and helpers to play the audio file of a word.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: fr
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports:
    stringdist,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
